// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P435158345" "Do I attend your hero tea parties?  No.  You shouldn't be messin' in my business either."

// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P804684666" "Please, let me go!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1580259352" "Please! I have a family!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4035074803" "Don't hurt me!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1064859891" "I don't know what it is that you want from me!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P106553879" "Can't you just leave me alone?  Why are you Outcasts so cruel??"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3686050323" "What is wrong with you?!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913315743" "Leave me alone!"

// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1891127451" "I can't thank you enough!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2630939056" "You're the best of the best!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P230542599" "That was phenomenal!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P976565583" "I was so scared!  Thank you so much for stepping in!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1520869681" "He was a very bad person.  Thank you so much for stepping in!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P39707596" "You are incredible!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P615004155" "What's your name again?  I want to memorize it so I can sing your praises!"

// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P863511769" "Outcasts rule and heroes drool!"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1250840359" "We're not scared of you!"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2324819885" "I'm in a fightin' mood.  How lucky for you, hero!"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2449358140" "I'm going to make your life miserable."
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2523325709" "The only way this fight ends is with one of us in the hospital.  So let's get to it, hero."

// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2787828412" "To the death!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2846144656" "You silly children will not prevail!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3397269239" "We will be sole masters of the Hollows!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3030063772" "Outcasts are nothing but a speck of annoyance.  Easily blotted out."
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3278340256" "Dispatch them quickly."
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1140476034" "You are nothing to the Circle of Thorns, Outcasts!"

// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3446538178" "This battle is ours!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P15406091" "Do not interfere!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3997608791" "You are a fool to step between us!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3741080365" "You would challenge us?"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P623291138" "You interfere in Circle of Thorns business!  A death sentence!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3588827743" "Now is the time for reckoning, hero!"
// CIRCLE_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P343528333" "Meddling hero!"

// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3830161727" "We gonna pound you!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1994362453" "You be dead soon!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4019316909" "Trolls! Rule! Hollows!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4111553906" "You pesky punks."
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3044024845" "Get lost!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3708185570" "You Outcast gonna hurt bad!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1781753722" "We got you number!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1903023030" "You ugly and dumb, Outcasts!"

// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P638347567" "This our fight!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P42561998" "New target!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1651118322" "Hero first."
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1959011149" "You in trouble now."
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2501089417" "Go away!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1815510139" "You no welcome here!"
// TROLLS_RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P609211965" "Get lost, hero!"

// STEEL_OUTCASTS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3771914048" "And then she told me I had to be home by 11 o'clock, can you believe that?"
// STEEL_OUTCASTS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P34430405" "Sometimes you just can't win."
// STEEL_OUTCASTS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2565007835" "Oh yea?"
// STEEL_OUTCASTS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2456186915" "Sometimes I wish we hung out in Kings Row, it's got such better crime!"
// STEEL_OUTCASTS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1755228113" "Do you ever feel we just do the same thing day after day?"
// STEEL_OUTCASTS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P135225940" "Keep an eye out for those Heroes, they have been everywhere lately!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3929884229" "I don't know how I feel about this Hollows business.  Not enough citizens to harass.  Slim pickins."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P470291899" "If you see a Hellion, let me know.  I'm gonna take a pot shot at him."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1084875594" "Well, Hollows is okay and all, but it's no Perez Park."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1574464034" "I'm going to be the snot out of the next guy I see."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2851073534" "You'll do!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2915802137" "You're dead meat!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P258857919" "Fresh meat!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1528452760" "Dead hero walking!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1340028629" "I think we need to upgrade our costumes.  What?  Hockey players upgrade their jerseys all the time."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1362405524" "Freaking heroes.  I hate 'em."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4098292083" "What's with all the goody goody squads in here?  Between the heroes, the PPD, Legacy Chain, and Freedom Corps, it's getting a mite too crowded for my tastes!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1387666339" "Whatever happened to simple mugging.  You know?  Where's the finesse gone?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2097959312" "I was talking here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3610098300" "Interrupt much?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3769471854" "Problems?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3342733537" "Yeah."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2435471667" "Right on, man."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3230305851" "You got it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4198971866" "Amen, pal."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P678129893" "That's right."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2150449024" "You bet."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1540333648" "What are we looking for, you ask?  We'll know when we find it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3098273726" "What?  We're just walking.  If we spot something promising, we'll go for it."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4036949598" "Why you gotta be the guy who always asks questions, huh?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3883198291" "Found something!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2937714678" "Okay.  So here's the plan:  we break in, take stuff, and run.  Any questions?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1554024592" "No.  We run second.  Break in first.  Are you kidding me with this?  This is why we get caught, people!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOT_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P322141237" "When in doubt, run."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2204923108" "Hey!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3288806850" "You're going down!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_PLOT_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3042204414" "You heard too much!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P615210471" "It's a great deal.  Trust me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1673504255" "Of course you can trust me.  Just keep this quiet, see?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2024400826" "You and me, we got a relationship.  I sell.  You buy.  No one the wiser.  Your  group doesn't need to know."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1545578057" "Of course this is a legitimate opportunity.  What do you take me for?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2814900917" "I'm a business man.  You have what I want."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P6325940" "You're the only one I deal with.  No one else.  Trust me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3471558200" "You and me, we're exclusive.  Trust me."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2481179625" "I don't know you!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1878149255" "You're a snitch!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_OUTCASTS_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1268625828" "Are you kidding me?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_HELLIONS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1425934547" "This better be good.  The other Hellions see me with you and I'm an outcast.  No offense."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_HELLIONS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3300190120" "How do I know you're not selling the same stuff on the side to the Skulls?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_HELLIONS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4205125544" "Yeah, I gotta think about this.  I can't afford to have my guys catch me dealing with you."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_RANDOM_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P818759683" "Sure this is the real deal?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_RANDOM_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2855351493" "Is this good stuff?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_RANDOM_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2870055467" "You sure this is the goods?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_RANDOM_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1384933997" "How do I know this is the best?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_SKULLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2847819670" "You and me, we're exclusive, right?  You're not dealing with Hellions on the side are you?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_SKULLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P317418512" "I would have a very difficult time doing business with you if I knew that you were dealing with, say, the Hellions, for example."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_SKULLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1277837009" "No one saw us, right?  I can't be seen with you."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_TROLLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P938618025" "These good?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_TROLLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P101061397" "You good sell?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_TROLLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P339514767" "Me want."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_TROLLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3228967017" "Me buy."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_TROLLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3588163730" "Me buy all."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_TROLLS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1561316636" "You get me Superadine?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_LOST_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3749459745" "Don't mess with me.  I have a destiny.  You need to be straight with me.  We're exclusive, right?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_LOST_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2587271574" "Hey...now why should I buy from you?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_LOST_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P910488522" "You need to prove your worth to me."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_LOST_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P960035231" "Hm.  I'm not sure about this."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_LOST_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3816179331" "Let me think on this."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_VAHZILOK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1385806354" "You realize that if you do me wrong, I will skin you and wear it for a coat."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_VAHZILOK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1511095737" "Well, you do have a palatable offer.  And would this offer be for my eyes only?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHADYDEAL_VAHZILOK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3238505356" "I don't need to tell you how dead you would be if any of my companions found out I was dealing with you.  Discretion is key."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_OUTCASTSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P439119827" "This is fun!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_OUTCASTSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2826747229" "Whee!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_OUTCASTSHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1809385351" "Round and round you go!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_OUTCASTSHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P297690464" "Oh, hey!  You wanna play, too?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_OUTCASTSHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1891730240" "Next!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_OUTCASTSHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2891390132" "You're up, hero!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOLOLEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P332622197" "Hey."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOLOLEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2491526200" "Oh, hero..."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SOLOLEDGESIT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3618878136" "Hello, hero."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1172819475" "Looks good, man."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4058496942" "You missed a spot."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1606288523" "Hm.  I don't think that looks like what you're trying to make it look like."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3787394403" "Are you on Superadine?   Cuz that looks funky."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1891921562" "Not bad."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3498223607" "Finish up later.  We got company."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2566618600" "Gonna have to put the spray can away.   We got business."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2072226347" "Hero alert."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3538953319" "Good stuff."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3499694772" "Think we got everything?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1218276902" "So...we got everything?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1489502281" "We good?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3362870391" "Ixne on the ealingste!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2182952719" "Ack!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3946624954" "Hero alert!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1903943369" "I think I got everything."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1268500404" "I'm gonna make some good money."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2870401405" "Like taking candy from a baby."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALING_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1645044564" "So easy."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2573407754" "Better at night."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2086353666" "No prying eyes at night.  Much better."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3444568910" "I like this much better."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404435140" "You!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2869278705" "What is WITH you?"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3249168753" "Heard that."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070081074" "I'm in total agreement."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_STEALINGNIGHT_TALKER2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3257214875" "I like this better."

